{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"54f1abb7f24ba8017fc449c695ca9d909afce97c6226c27c3ddb7c10728155de","ja":"無事、完成？","zh":"顺利完成？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ec4922a674f0faefaed487928f08509cd2f0b206f09974c5680aba1021dbca25","ja":"ごめんなさい！\n私の指示、わかりづらかったよね。","zh":"对不起！\n我的指示太难懂了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a83af41a71bea8795f9e5b0e739b5e9b2c0e32aaffbf8015f0a9b890a678a7e1","ja":"ふたりが向かい合ってパーツを運ぶわけだから、\nそれぞれに指示を出さなきゃ……気を付けるね！","zh":"因为是两人面对面搬运零件，\n得分别发出指示才行……我会小心的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1de2fe46306c639bad6302ec54fac45dc297ef7d457ec51b1136a6386f9e4906","ja":"ありがとうございま～す！　でも、\n私たちももっと、声をかけあわないとダメかなーって。","zh":"非常感谢～！不过，\n我觉得我们之间也得更多地互相应和才行呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3abf6336550b33e0ec3985257e9dde3def232478fbd358d07260b3774c85c783","ja":"タイミングを合わせられたら、もっとリラックスして\nできますね。ナイスアイデアです、ヤヨイ！","zh":"只要抓准时机，就能更轻松地\n完成了呢。真是个好主意，弥生！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"493669fdd9b005fe8cd054ccb988c57fb2aabdaeb59d026da190c0407a845959","ja":"うっうー！　それじゃあ、\n声をかけながら、落ち着いてやりましょ～！","zh":"呜～呜～！那么，\n大家一边互相打招呼，一边冷静地做吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b54fdfc9695136c52f60825a817d07a205200e06f4163c00dda29bf5af48d0e2","ja":"やっぱり実践って大事だね！\nそれじゃあ、もう1回最初からやってみよう！","zh":"实践果然很重要呢！\n那么，再从头试1次吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c7a71dc6b3d3a8d70e4b59c057a66f8448319546592e272862b5af193d2dd5f8","ja":"苦労しながらも、\nひとまずパーツをすべて置き終えて……","zh":"虽然颇费了一番功夫，\n但总算把零件全都摆放完毕了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d36ff927558c7b302729e42a4fc64740491dc32a3f307a356a1e7f69c00b2dae","ja":"パーツはこれで全部だよね。\nけど……ふたりも、こっちから見てくれない？","zh":"零件这样就全了吧。\n不过……你们两个也能从这边看看吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"6e8f180ff7520484b1cb36a421b4b72d15ccc9bdabab2b7f135c3991cfdf46ab","ja":"うまくできましたか？\n…………はっ、これはっ！","zh":"完成得还顺利吗？\n…………啊，这是……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"2e9ef69d31d4cf242f069d4401c5eb6931dab8db751758d5c174a70955f8853d","ja":"なんだか、全部のパーツがずれちゃってますね。","zh":"感觉所有的零件都错位了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b375957deb62efaf03287a8fc7a9baeaedf73ae815ed8dc087e3f45b4f9ac845","ja":"やよいちゃんも、そう思う？　指示しながら、\nなんとかバランスを取ろうとしたんだけど……。","zh":"弥生也这么觉得吗？我一边指示，\n一边总算想要保持好平衡……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"67fade3678b45474839b3ef68a88e4d50fc3341694bed6437333bd1ff0d7de57","ja":"番組だったら、失敗って言われちゃうかも。","zh":"要是录节目的话，说不定会被说成是失败呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"f69c429e7b5871b7f90cf9174c387deb45a3e0777beadd3e377d084b7fa5492c","ja":"いえ！　ワンダフルです！　\n偶然が生み出したバランスがミラクルで……。","zh":"不！太棒了！\n偶然造就的平衡感简直是奇迹……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1697.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d6cdb8bf46d0dedcb2d059af511d515b88dae96f8dabe3b285ac11decf120563","ja":"おかげで、マーベラスなアートが完成しました！","zh":"多亏了您，绝妙的艺术作品完成了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
